<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="text-center mb-5">
    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">
      Clear Glass Braces
    </h1>

    <p class="lead leadtext mb-4">
      Clear glass braces are the same size and shape as metal braces, except that they are clear to help make a fixed brace look more invisible.
    </p>

    <p class="lead leadtext mb-4 fst-italic">
      Clear Braces typically range in price between £3,000 – £7,000.
    </p>
  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= HERO IMAGE ================= -->
<div class="treatment-hero-fullwidth">
  <%= image_tag "braces/clear_braces_redhead.jpg",
      class: "treatment-hero-img",
      alt: "Clear Glass Braces" %>
</div>

<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-center">
      Clear Braces by Redhead Orthodontics
    </h3>

    <p class="mb-4 text-center">
      Technically Beautiful
    </p>

    <p class="lead mb-4 leadtext">
    
      Redhead Orthodontics uses a very special clear brace. This bracket delivers exceptionally accurate and fast results with features that other cosmetic brackets just can’t match.
    </p>

  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mb-5 text-center" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <p class="mb-4">
      Watch this short video for more detail on Clear Glass Outside Braces
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- VIDEO ROW -->
  <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center mb-5 g-4">

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
      <p class="fs-5">
        Watch this short video for more detail on Clear Glass Outside Braces
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6 text-center">

      <div class="video-thumb">
        <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/VIDEO_ID/hqdefault.jpg"
             alt="Clear Braces Video"
             class="img-fluid rounded-4 shadow">

        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID"
           target="_blank"
           class="video-play">
          ▶
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-center">
      Clear Sapphire
    </h3>

    <p class="lead mb-4 leadtext">
      It is the clearest bracket available in the world, each bracket is created from a single crystal of pure sapphire – one of the hardest materials in nature, second only to diamond. The crystal is honed and heat polished into a remarkably strong and beautiful bracket that’s nearly invisible on the teeth.
    </p>

  </div>

  <div class="text-center mb-5">

    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">
      Is an outside clear fixed brace best for me?
    </h3>

    <p class="lead mb-4 leadtext">
      Take our fun, quick 1 min Best Braces Quiz to establish if this is the right brace for you or Book an Appointment to speak with Dr Redhead himself.
    </p>

    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-center gap-3">

      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-4">
        SEE OUR RANGE OF BRACES
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg rounded-pill px-4 fw-semibold">
        TAKE THE BEST BRACE QUIZ
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg rounded-pill px-4">
        READ OUR GOOGLE REVIEWS
      </a>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-4">
      <a href="#top" class="text-muted">
        [ back to the top ]
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<%= render "appointments/form", appointment: @appointment %>
<%= render "proud_members" %>
<%= render "footer" %>


<style>
.video-thumb {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
}

.video-play {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  font-size: 3rem;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.treatment-hero-fullwidth {
  width: 100%;
  margin: 40px 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.treatment-hero-img {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: 450px;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}
</style>
